# Source media — never commit raw assets (>50MB limit, unprocessed originals).
# The raw folders themselves (Video/, PRESS PICS/, SHOW PICS/, PDF ASSETS/) live
# one level above this repo and are never inside it — only these extension/path
# guards matter, kept narrow so they can't shadow compressed output in public/.
*.mov
*.MOV
*.ai
*.AI
*.docx
*.psd
/public/img/brand/symbol-source.png
